      "title": "Upcoming dorm renovations",
      "description": "The Oak Hall dorms will be undergoing renovations during the winter break. These renovations will include updates to common areas, improved Wi-Fi infrastructure, and energy-efficient lighting. We appreciate your patience during this time as we work to improve your living space.",
